Package: smma
Type: Package
Title: Source Mixture Matching Analysis for Receptor-Model Factors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nicolas", "Pelletier", email = "nicolas.pelletier@ec.gc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Environment and Climate Change Canada", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: Tools to interpret factors resolved by Positive Matrix
    Factorization (PMF) or other receptor models by fitting each factor
    profile as a non-negative mixture of an external library of measured
    source profiles (bootstrapped, weighted non-negative least squares),
    and to propagate the resulting source weights back to samples for
    any grouping of analytes. Also provides profile-distance metrics,
    diagnostic ratios and alkylation indices for polycyclic aromatic
    compounds, distance-based site classification, and spatial
    distance-decay regressions. Analyte names, groupings and source
    categories are user-configurable.
